      "writtenOn": "2023-02-23T19:30:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if PLTRST is low, wouldn\u0027t you also set `ap_booted` to false?\n\ni think that\u0027ll mean we won\u0027t have a hard dependency\non the `RESET_CNT` event coming in (i.e. being called).",
